<title>FINLAND: NESTE SAYS SOLD MT KIISLA VESSEL.</title>
<headline>NESTE SAYS SOLD MT KIISLA VESSEL.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish oil and energy group Neste Oy said in a statement on Wednesday it had sold its Mt Kiisla vessel due to extra costs that the 22-year old vessel brought.</p>
<p>The price of the 6,863 deadweight tonnes vessel was not disclosed.</p>
<p>&quot;It was decided that the vessel be given up mainly due to extra costs than its old age bring,&quot; Neste said.</p>
</text>
